code-worktree-gotchas]] | Worktree gotchas: ExitWorktree remove branch deletion, CRLF normalization, Windows MAX_PATH sparse-checkout workaround; plus git update-index --refresh as non-destructive resolution for CRLF phantom diffs | 2026-05-22.md, 2026-06-17.md | 2026-06-17 |\n| [[concepts/baylor-load-simulator-fall-camp-mode]] | Fall Camp mode software (Plans 1 and 3 merged dormant) now cross-linked to its 2026-05-29 domain model (Color Triad, rep ramp, two-currency model) | 2026-05-26.md, 2026-05-29.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/msys-git-bash-fork-errors]] | MSYS Git Bash intermittent `add_item ... fork` heap errors on Windows: restart terminal, `rebaseall`, or split heavy git commands | 2026-05-26.md | 2026-05-26 |\n| [[concepts/dormant-feature-season-gated-deployment]] | Pattern for shipping dormant seasonal feature code to production early, gated by data availability rather than a runtime flag | 2026-05-26.md | 2026-05-26 |\n| [[concepts/claude-ai-skill-porting]] | Porting 8 personal skills from claude.ai web UI to ~/.claude/skills/ via Playwright; SKILL.md-only recovery, lean-reference discipline, Marp optional format | 2026-05-28.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/project-docs-file-map-pattern]] | File-map section pattern in CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md documenting exported API surfaces to reduce per-session source-file re-reads | 2026-05-28.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/baylor-fall-camp-practice-planning-model]] | Color Triad, K-State Rosetta Stone, rep ramp, two-currency model, B1 calibration, and 2026-06-04 extension: active minutes as macro anchor metric and work-block periodization unit | 2026-05-29.md, 2026-06-02.md, 2026-06-04.md | 2026-06-04 |\n| [[concepts/baylor-wtn-acwr-analysis]] | Baylor Women's Tennis ACWR pipeline: weekly-sampled ratio, NCAA-compliant counterfactual ramp overlay, counterfactual-start-window bug, now cross-linked to the contaminated-baselines connection | 2026-05-29.md | 2026-08-07 |\n| [[concepts/end-of-day-structured-interview]] | 4-q